<title>PHILIPPINES: Empire East denies bankruptcy rumour.</title>
<headline>Empire East denies bankruptcy rumour.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mass housing builder Empire East Land Holdings Inc on Tuesday denied rumours in the stockmarket that it was about to declare bankruptcy.</p>
<p>&quot;We categorically and vehemently deny the rumours circulated in the stock exchanges today alleging that Empire East has declared, or is about to declare, bankruptcy,&quot; corporate secretary Enrique Santos Sy said in a letter to the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
